<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We are running a race,</l><l>Pressing on each day toward the goal.</l><l>We are running a race;</l><l>Christ the prize we hold in view.</l><l>Fleeing youthful lusts,</l><l>But faith, love, peace, and righteousness pursue;</l><l>(Insert name), I need you.</l><l>Be my companion.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I’m an ear that can’t see;</l><l>There are many things that I can’t do.</l><l>You’re an eye that can’t hear;</l><l>See, I have my function too.</l><l>We’re an eye and an ear,</l><l>So we need arms and legs and pinky toes.</l><l>(Insert name), we need them;</l><l>We’re one living Body.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
